    {
      "index": 3,
      "className": "sec-lg",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "THE DIFFERENCE"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WE WILL INVEST 100,000 BDT TO LAUNCH YOUR BUSINESS"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We don’t just give you advice and guidance. We work with you. We invest 100,000 BDT in your business and become true partners."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "That means our reach, our network, our designers, developers and marketers, and our capital are all working for your business. We want you to win — because we win when you win."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "This is an incubation program, to launch more businesses in the ecosystem."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "className": "sec-lg",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "WHAT YOU GET"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "EVERYTHING YOU NEED TO BUILD A COMPANY — IN ONE PLACE"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hire a team, an agency, and a consultant separately and you’d spend far more — and still have no one with money in the game. Here it’s all under one roof, with partners who are invested."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Access to our private idea bank"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Detailed, vetted idea docs we normally keep to ourselves. Pick one, or bring your own and we pressure-test it together."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "My team builds your brand, website & identity"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Logo, brand, full website, digital identity — designed and built by the same team behind our own companies. Not advice. Done."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We build or source your product"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Whether it's a physical product to import or a digital product to build, we get it made and ready to sell."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Done-with-you go-to-market & marketing"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Positioning, offer, pricing, content, ads, SEO — the same growth engine we use to grow our own ventures, pointed at yours."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Direct line to us — all 12 months"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Email and WhatsApp access throughout. Stuck at 11pm? Message us. You're never building alone."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We invest in you and become partners"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We put 100,000 BDT of our own money into your business and take 20%. Real skin in the game — we only win when you win."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
