    {
      "index": 6,
      "className": "sec-lg",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "THE 12-MONTH BUILD"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "FROM IDEA TO A RUNNING BUSINESS, MONTH BY MONTH"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A clear, twelve-month path we walk together. No guesswork about what comes next."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Month 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Lock the idea"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We choose what you'll build. Use our private idea bank or bring your own — we pressure-test it until it's something worth a year of your life. If you don't have an idea, we bring you one."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Months 2–3"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Build or import the product"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We get the actual product made. Source and import it, or build it — so by month three you have something real to sell, not a slide deck."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Month 4"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Branding, website & digital identity"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "My team creates the whole thing for you — brand, logo, website, digital presence. You show up looking like a serious company from day one."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Month 5"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Go-to-market strategy"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We finalise exactly how you enter the market: who you sell to, your offer, your pricing, your channels, and the precise sequence of first moves."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Month 6"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Marketing strategy"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We build the growth engine — content, ads, SEO, partnerships — using what's worked across our own ventures, tailored to your business."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Months 7–9"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Launch & first revenue"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We go live and chase the hardest milestone there is: your first paying customers. This is where most people get stuck. With us, you don't."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Months 10–12"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Scale what works"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "We double down on what's working, cut what isn't, and build momentum — so you finish the year with a business you can actually run."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "className": "sec-lg",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "This is for you if…"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✓\nYou're serious about building a real business and will do the work",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "✓\nYou can invest in yourself and commit to a full 12 months",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "✓\nYou're early (an idea) or stuck (launched but not growing)",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "✓\nYou want real partners with money, a team, and a network behind you",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "This is not for you if…"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✕\nYou want a get-rich-quick shortcut or passive income",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "✕\nYou can't commit time, money, or follow-through for a year",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "✕\nYou're not open to honest, direct feedback",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "✕\nYou want to keep 100% and just buy a few hours of advice",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "className": "sec-lg",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "THE INVESTMENT"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT IT COSTS"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "You pay 300,000 BDT. We pay 100,000 BDT — plus our time, our effort, our resources, our guidance, and everything else. You own 80% of the business, we own 20%. We become partners and do it together."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Our guarantee"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "If you do the work and we haven’t started a running business together in 12 months, we keep going for another 12 months — completely free. We don’t stop until you have a business."
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "text": "Apply for one of 10–20 spots →",
          "href": "#apply",
          "imgs": []
        }
      ]
    },
